{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13218240","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13218240","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1321823001:":{"text":"我感觉到了……","source_cn":"我感觉到了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD957B9B18E3CA5F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1321823002:":{"text":"血脉的共鸣！","source_cn":"血脉的共鸣！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B3D93F64DA5D853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321824001:1":{"text":"女孩母亲的遗骸与我有了隐约的共鸣，也就是说……虽然稀薄，但她确实有瓦勒沙家族的血脉。","source_cn":"女孩母亲的遗骸与我有了隐约的共鸣，也就是说……虽然稀薄...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CF3AFF5CCCD5E06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321824002:1":{"text":"也就是说……那些恶魔眷属感受到了这位女士遗骨中的血脉能量，所以才攻击了奥尔嘉的父亲……就只因为他携带着妻子的遗骨？","source_cn":"也就是说……那些恶魔眷属感受到了这位女士遗骨中的血脉能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F8E4EA33F9EE5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321824003:1":{"text":"从现有的条件来看，的确如此。","source_cn":"从现有的条件来看，的确如此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F11D021776FD46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321824004:1":{"text":"如果这一切都成立，那么奥尔嘉……她当然也从她的母亲那里继承到了瓦勒沙家族那古老而高贵的血脉。","source_cn":"如果这一切都成立，那么奥尔嘉……她当然也从她的母亲那里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC29CA798BACF7488","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321824005:1":{"text":"所以这个孩子就是瓦勒沙家族之人，瓦勒沙家族……竟然还有血脉后裔存在？","source_cn":"所以这个孩子就是瓦勒沙家族之人，瓦勒沙家族……竟然还有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF042F5310B11B26A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321824006:1":{"text":"我的魔法……我的魔法应该是不会出错的，所以这一切都是真的？先祖庇佑，瓦勒沙家族……仍有血脉尚存于世？","source_cn":"我的魔法……我的魔法应该是不会出错的，所以这一切都是真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9236FC137A1D0699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321824007:1":{"text":"法拉莫尔，我想看看奥尔嘉父亲携带的笔记或者文件，或许能在其中找到些内容来确认这件事。","source_cn":"法拉莫尔，我想看看奥尔嘉父亲携带的笔记或者文件，或许能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF833AC5FD81C53E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321824008:1":{"text":"这需要奥尔嘉的同意。","source_cn":"这需要奥尔嘉的同意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD541CF8DE4165D0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321824009:1":{"text":"奥尔嘉，没事的，不要一直躲在我背后。这位先生希望能确认你是否是瓦勒沙家族的后裔，想看看你们的笔记或者文件，可以吗？","source_cn":"奥尔嘉，没事的，不要一直躲在我背后。这位先生希望能确认...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCF8145E357C2FDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321824010:1":{"text":"瓦勒沙家族？后裔？我不懂你说的话……","source_cn":"瓦勒沙家族？后裔？我不懂你说的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C7E95C2B599AE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321824011:1":{"text":"我爸爸没有什么笔记，但妈妈有一本……她去世以后我一直随身带着。如果法拉莫尔想看的话，就拿去看吧。","source_cn":"我爸爸没有什么笔记，但妈妈有一本……她去世以后我一直随...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDC6C99EF386F4D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321824012:1":{"text":"谢谢你，奥尔嘉。","source_cn":"谢谢你，奥尔嘉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8E252FE2190199A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:24:13021828:0":{"text":"柳博米尔通过血脉感应的魔法阵来确认奥尔嘉母亲的身世，伴随着法阵的光芒，柳博米尔似乎有了答案。","source_cn":"柳博米尔通过血脉感应的魔法阵来确认奥尔嘉母亲的身世，伴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E170A88E780652D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"柳博米尔","source":